# This workspace also contains footage and earlier prototypes. Only TAP belongs here.
/*
!/app/
!/README.md
!/.gitignore

# Local settings, credentials and generated output.
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/node_modules/

# Historical research and exercise reviews are retained locally.
/app/docs/research/
/app/docs/audits/
/app/docs/DESIGN.md
/app/docs/UX.md
/app/docs/USABILITY_REVIEW.md
/app/docs/PLAYBACK_EXERCISE.md
/app/docs/SWISS_SYMBOLOGY_ASSESSMENT.md

